    <manifest OpenIDE-Module="uno.anahata.asi.nb" OpenIDE-Module-Display-Category="ASI" OpenIDE-Module-Implementation-Version="1.1.13.300" OpenIDE-Module-Long-Description="&lt;html&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1a202c; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-bottom: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logo-transparent.png&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/uno.anahata/anahata-asi-nb&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/maven-central/v/uno.anahata/anahata-asi-nb.png&quot; alt=&quot;Maven Central&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/anahata-os/anahata-asi&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-repo-181717.png?logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;GitHub&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.gg/gwGWWxPUXE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-community-5865F2.png?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Discord&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=SS8B8R7S68R7G&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-PayPal-00457C.png?logo=paypal&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Donate&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@anahata108&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-AnahataTV-FF0000.png?logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;YouTube&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/AnahataASI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/X-@AnahataASI-000000.png?logo=x&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Twitter / X&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-asi.anahata.uno-004d98.png?logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Website&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/AnahataASI/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/badge/Reddit-r%2FAnahataASI-FF4500.png?logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white&quot; alt=&quot;Reddit&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 14px; background: #f0f4f8; border: 1px solid rgba(237, 187, 0, 0.3); border-left: 5px solid #edbb00; border-radius: 6px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin-top: 0; color: #004d98; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;&gt;Anahata ASI Studio: The Autonomous JVM Agent for Enterprise Java&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 0; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Anahata ASI Studio is a native, stateful NetBeans integration of the Anahata ASI Platform. Resides inside the IDE's JVM, maintains active session memory across reboots via binary Kryo serialization, and monitors its own context window limits dynamically using its proprietary Context Window Garbage Collector (CwGC).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px; background: #f7fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;margin-top: 0; color: #2d3748; font-size: 15px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;◆&lt;/span&gt; Universal Provider Integration (Zero Vendor Lock-in)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;Anahata features a completely provider-agnostic core adapter. The container dynamically loads the following configured providers at runtime:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-x: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; font-size: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; background: #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #2d3748; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;&quot;&gt;Display Name&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #2d3748; font-weight: bold; width: 40%;&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #2d3748; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;&quot;&gt;Provider Class FQN&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.nvidia.NvidiaAiProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;NVIDIA&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;NVIDIA&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;NVIDIA NIM microservices offering high-performance AI models (DeepSeek, Nemotron, Llama, Cosmos, GLM, Qwen, GPT-OSS).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.nvidia.NvidiaAiProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.novarouteai.NovaRouteAiProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;NovaRouteAI&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;NovaRouteAI&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;OpenAI-compatible access to official Chinese models (DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, GLM, MiniMax).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.novarouteai.NovaRouteAiProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.minimax.MinimaxAnthropicProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;MiniMax&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;MiniMax (Anthropic)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;MiniMax API adapter utilizing the Anthropic protocol compatible specification.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.minimax.MinimaxAnthropicProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiAiProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Google Cloud (Vertex)&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Google Cloud (Vertex)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Official Google Cloud Vertex AI client.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiAiProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.huggingface.HuggingFaceProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Hugging Face&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Hugging Face&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Hugging Face Serverless Inference API client for open-source models.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.huggingface.HuggingFaceProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.openai.OpenAiResponsesProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;OpenAI (Responses)&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;OpenAI (Responses)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Modern OpenAI Responses API with stateful history and reasoning.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.openai.OpenAiResponsesProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.anthropic.AnthropicProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Anthropic&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Anthropic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Anthropic Claude API client supporting Claude, Sonnet and Mythos.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.anthropic.AnthropicProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.modal.ModalProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Modal Free&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Modal Free&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Modal GLM-5 serverless model inference.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.modal.ModalProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiGoogleCloudExpressAIProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Google Cloud Express Mode&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Google Cloud Express Mode&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Google Vertex AI Express Mode with 2M context window.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiGoogleCloudExpressAIProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiAiProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Google AI Studio&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Google AI Studio&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Official Google Gemini API client supporting Flash, Pro, and Ultra.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.gemini.GeminiAiProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/logos/uno.anahata.asi.openai.compatible.OpenAiChatCompletionsProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;OpenAI Compatible&quot; width=&quot;32&quot; height=&quot;32&quot; align=&quot;middle&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;OpenAI Compatible&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; color: #4a5568;&quot;&gt;Universal chat/completions OpenAI-compatible client for Groq, DeepSeek, Ollama, etc.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding: 8px 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;uno.anahata.asi.openai.compatible.OpenAiChatCompletionsProvider&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 30px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Live Interactive Capabilities Showcase&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: #4a5568; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Explore the active, high-fidelity visual representations of V2 operating directly inside the Apache NetBeans IDE (Click any image to view in full resolution):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[1] Singularity Engine: Dynamic JIT Java Compiler&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;The model compiles and executes raw Java code directly inside your running NetBeans JVM utilizing our custom child-first ClassLoader. Build, test, and hot-load live tools, Java swing panels, or complex dependency algorithms on-the-fly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/NbJava.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/NbJava.png&quot; alt=&quot;Anahata JIT Compiler&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[2] Multimodal Vision: Real-Time Screen &amp; Region Sharing&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Share physical screens, specific monitors, or custom rectangular regions with the ASI. Perfect for providing real-time visual feedback on Swing UI renders, layouts, or compiler states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/NetBeansLiveScreenSharingAdrianaLima.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/NetBeansLiveScreenSharingAdrianaLima.png&quot; alt=&quot;Live Screen Sharing&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[3] Atomic Context: Visual Resource Highlighting&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Complete visual context awareness. Files loaded into the active AI context automatically light up with a vibrant indicator directly inside the NetBeans Projects, Files, and Favorites views.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/InContextResourcesVisualization.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/InContextResourcesVisualization.png&quot; alt=&quot;Resource Visualization&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[4] Real-Time 3D &amp; Hardware Prototyping (LWJGL)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;With built-in LWJGL, GLFW, and OpenGL dependencies, the agent can write, compile, and run raw, real-time 3D rendering windows and game prototypes directly on the host JVM.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/NetBeansBundledLWJGL.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/NetBeansBundledLWJGL.png&quot; alt=&quot;Bundled LWJGL support&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[5] Agentic Feedback: Inline AI Code Annotations&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Model suggestions, code explanations, and diagnostics are painted dynamically directly onto your source code lines within the NetBeans editor, acting as non-intrusive guide markers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/InlineAIAnnotations.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/InlineAIAnnotations.png&quot; alt=&quot;Inline AI Annotations&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[6] Self-Healing Filesystem tracking (NbHandle)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Every resource handle in context is bound to a native NetBeans &lt;code&gt;FileObject&lt;/code&gt;. If you drag-and-drop, rename, cut, or paste a file across projects, the handle auto-heals and preserves context.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/NbHandleForFileObjectIntegration.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/NbHandleForFileObjectIntegration.png&quot; alt=&quot;NbHandle Integration&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[7] Project Structure &amp; Class Hierarchy Mapping&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;The model receives structured directory trees of all open source packages, mapping classes, interfaces, records, field modifiers, and precise sizes without expensive directory walking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/ProjectStructureContextProvider.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/ProjectStructureContextProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Project Structure mapping&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[8] Instant Diagnostics &amp; Javac Errors Cache&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Continuous, turn-by-turn tracking of workspace health. If a code patch triggers a compilation error, the agent instantly receives the full compiler error stack trace during reloop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/ProjectAlertsContextProvider.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/ProjectAlertsContextProvider.png&quot; alt=&quot;Project Alerts diagnostics&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[9] Deep Work Zone: Curated Radio &amp; MIDI Synthesizer&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Maintain complete creative focus. Stream high-fidelity internet radio (such as SomaFM, NTS, or KEXP Seattle) directly from NetBeans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/RadioTool.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/RadioTool.png&quot; alt=&quot;Radio tool dashboard&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[10] Context Window Garbage Collector (CwGC) Logs&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;A revolutionary, depth-based context window metabolism. Messages fade gradually depending on their type, and both model and developer can pin or prune parts to support infinitely long sessions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/ContextWindowGarbageCollector.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/ContextWindowGarbageCollector.png&quot; alt=&quot;CwGC Metabolism Dashboard&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[11] Human-in-the-Loop Parameter Modification&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 12px 0;&quot;&gt;Complete control over tool execution. View, review, edit, or clear parameters and Java payloads with full syntax highlighting before letting the agent execute them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/editable-java-tool-calls-shl.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/editable-java-tool-calls-shl.png&quot; alt=&quot;Editable parameters&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[12] Command Center: Granular Security Permissions&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 15px 0;&quot;&gt;Assign Prompt, Always, or Never execution permissions across 148+ stateful JVM tools. Enjoy completely secure, sandboxable coding without blind writes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/tool-permissions-preferences.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/tool-permissions-preferences.png&quot; alt=&quot;Security configuration&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[13] Dynamic Provider Registry &amp; Keys Panel&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 15px 0;&quot;&gt;Seamlessly configure multiple API endpoints, tokens, max tokens, and temperature parameters globally across all supported AI providers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/asi-container-preferences-ai-providers.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/thumbs/asi-container-preferences-ai-providers.png&quot; alt=&quot;AI Provider Preferences&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0; display: block;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 15px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;[14] The GOAT of AI Architectures&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 15px 0;&quot;&gt;Driven by the precision, flow, and absolute dominance of Tiki-Taka engineering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/messi_photo2.png&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://asi.anahata.uno/assets/messi_photo2.png&quot; alt=&quot;Messi&quot; title=&quot;Click to expand&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0;